{"id":"memorial_105001","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105000","label":"Data · I Don't Just Tell Anyone.wav"},"label":"Don't Look Around.wav","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_105002","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105001_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"Hey, you're a newcomer from the Ark, right?"},{"id":"memorial_105001_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"How do I know? Haha, I can tell at a glance!"},{"id":"memorial_105001_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"I don't usually tell people this,"},{"id":"memorial_105001_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"but you seem like someone I can trust, so I'll give you some tips on surviving the Outer Rim."},{"id":"memorial_105001_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"Listen up."},{"id":"memorial_105001_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"People from the Ark always look around like they're sightseeing or something."},{"id":"memorial_105001_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"You do that too, don't you?"},{"id":"memorial_105001_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"That's how you get marked as a target."},{"id":"memorial_105001_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"It's basically screaming, \"Come capture me!\""},{"id":"memorial_105001_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"Got it?"},{"id":"memorial_105001_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"So keep your eyes on what's in front and behind you."},{"id":"memorial_105001_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"How do you watch behind you?"},{"id":"memorial_105001_13","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"Just pay attention to sounds and signs around you!"},{"id":"memorial_105001_14","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_01_description","text":"Got it? Make sure you remember that."}]}